{
  "cmd_full_name": "ccc make-call",
  "cmd_name": "make-call",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "You can invoke MakeCall to initiate a call. The callee can be an internal agent or an external customer",
  "description_zh": "调用MakeCall发起呼叫，被叫可以是内部坐席，也可以是外部客户 ",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun ccc make-call --instance-id ccc-test --user-id agent@ccc-test --device-id device --caller 0109890000 --callee 13188880000 --timeout-seconds 30 --tags tags --masked-callee 13100008888 --media-type AUDIO --flash-sms-variables applicationId_:_6bd18325-ea7f-4881-8902-4d06283d3b3b_,_templateId_:_1722217249064 --api-version 2020-07-01 --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET|POST",
  "multi_version": true,
  "name": "MakeCall",
  "operation": {
    "action": "MakeCall",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2020-07-01",
    "method": "POST",
    "operation_type": "readAndWrite",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "system_operation_type": "get",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "doc_required": true,
      "example": "ccc-test",
      "help_en": "Instance ID.  ",
      "help_zh": "实例ID",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "instance_id",
      "options": [
        "--instance-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "InstanceId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "agent@ccc-test",
      "help_en": "Agent ID initiating the outbound call. This field is optional. If not specified, the system uses the agent mapped to the current RAM user by default.  ",
      "help_zh": "发起外呼的坐席ID，非必填，不填默认使用当前RAM账号映射的坐席",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "user_id",
      "options": [
        "--user-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "UserId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "doc_required": true,
      "example": "device",
      "help_en": "Device ID. This field is meaningless and can be filled with any value.  ",
      "help_zh": "设备ID，无意义，可以随便填写",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "device_id",
      "options": [
        "--device-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "DeviceId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "010989****",
      "help_en": "Caller number. This parameter is invalid for internal calls. For outbound calls, specify an outbound number available to the current agent. Ensure that the number supports outbound calling and that the agent has permission to use it. Permission can be granted in two ways: either by attaching the number to the skill group the agent signed into, or by setting the number as the agent's personal outbound number.  ",
      "help_zh": "主叫号码，如果是内部呼叫，这此参数无效，如果是外部呼叫，此参数为当前坐席可用的外呼号码，需要确保该号码可外呼且坐席对该号码有使用权，使用权通过两种途径获得，一是将号码绑定到当前坐席签入的技能组上，二是将号码设置为坐席的个人外呼号码",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "caller",
      "options": [
        "--caller"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Caller",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "doc_required": true,
      "example": "1318888****",
      "help_en": "Callee number. For internal calls, specify the target agent's extension number in this field. For outbound calls, specify the customer's phone number.  ",
      "help_zh": "被叫号码，如果是内部呼叫，该字段填写目标坐席的分机号，如果是外呼呼叫，填写客户的电话号码",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "callee",
      "options": [
        "--callee"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Callee",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "30",
      "help_en": "Timeout. If the call is not answered within the time specified by this parameter, the system automatically hangs up. Valid values range from 30 to 300 seconds.  ",
      "help_zh": "超时时间，呼叫在经过该参数指定的时间仍然未接通的情况下，则主动挂断，取值范围30-300，单位秒",
      "location": "query",
      "maximum": "300",
      "minimum": "30",
      "name": "timeout_seconds",
      "options": [
        "--timeout-seconds"
      ],
      "raw_name": "TimeoutSeconds",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "tags",
      "help_en": "Ingest endpoint data. The customer does not need to concern themselves with this",
      "help_zh": "随路数据，客户无需关心",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "tags",
      "options": [
        "--tags"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Tags",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "131****8888",
      "help_en": "The desensitized callee number. If this field is not empty, it indicates that the callee number must be desensitized. The desensitization rule is defined by the customer. You only need to enter the desensitized callee number here. Using a desensitized callee number means that in certain scenarios, you will see the desensitized callee number and cannot view the real callee number",
      "help_zh": "脱敏后的被叫号码，如果该字段不为空，表示需要对被叫号码脱敏，脱敏规则由客户自行定义，只需将脱敏后的被叫号码填入即可，使用脱敏被叫会导致某些场景下看到的是脱敏后的被叫号码，无法查看真实被叫号码",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "masked_callee",
      "options": [
        "--masked-callee"
      ],
      "raw_name": "MaskedCallee",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "AUDIO",
      "help_en": "Media type. The default value is AUDIO. Other valid values include VIDEO.  ",
      "help_zh": "媒体类型，默认是语音(AUDIO), 其他可选参数包括VIDEO",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "media_type",
      "options": [
        "--media-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "MediaType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "{\\\"applicationId\\\":\\\"6bd18325-ea7f-4881-8902-4d06283d3b3b\\\",\\\"templateId\\\":\\\"1722217249064\\\"}",
      "help_en": "Flash SMS configuration  ",
      "help_zh": "闪信配置",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "flash_sms_variables",
      "options": [
        "--flash-sms-variables"
      ],
      "raw_name": "FlashSmsVariables",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
